{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1350206-owod-mdt-manager-tool-to-create-characters","id":1350206,"title":"oWod / MDT Manager : Tool to create characters","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-11-22T01:17:02-08:00","id":1350206,"title":"oWod / MDT Manager : Tool to create characters","content":"Hello everyone,<br /> <br /> I'm game master for Vampire, Mage and Werewolf (classic WoD) since several years, from firsts editions to 20th (yes, I'm old ... !)<br /> Slowly, I developed a software to manage / generate characters for my players, but in French ...<br /> <br /> Recently, I upgraded it to 20th anniversary editions, and since most of oWoD community speak English, I decided to translate to share it with English community.<br /> If you're interested in testing it, you can find it here : <a href=\"http://insomniaks.fr/index_en.html\" target=\"_blank\">oWod / MDT Manager</a><br /> <br /> I'll appreciate any suggestions, requests, bugs reports, translations errors, ... all that can make it evolve !<br /> <br /> Actual functionalities :<br /> - Manage / Edit characters sheets for Vampire V20 and Mage M20,<br /> - Export of 4 pages filled character sheet in PDF format<br /> <br /> As the development is in progress, some pop-ups may not have been translated (or badly ...).<br /> I'm also plan to manage Werewolf W20, but it will need a some time.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://insomniaks.fr/Images/screen_mdtmanager_240b1_01.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Kryane - <a href=\"http://insomniaks.fr/index_en.html\" target=\"_blank\">Insomniaks</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"l